.venv
.git
.github
frontend
# Bulk pipeline artifacts stay out (gpr_index/data is ~810 GB locally), but
# two paths under them are read by the API at *runtime* and must ship:
#   gpr_index/outputs/validation      -> api/metrics_service.py:14-18 (/api/pages/quality)
#   nifty-50/output/sector_factors.json -> api/portfolio_service.py:62 (fitted betas)
# Without them the API still boots: quality degrades, and portfolio scores
# silently fall back to _PRIOR_FACTORS. Order matters — the re-include must
# follow the exclude.
gpr_index/outputs
!gpr_index/outputs/validation
gpr_index/data
nifty-50/output
!nifty-50/output/sector_factors.json
# .dockerignore patterns match the *whole path*, so a bare `__pycache__` only
# matches one at the repo root — nested ones were being sent to the daemon.
# `**/` is what makes these recursive.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
# AppleDouble sidecars: this repo lives on an exFAT volume, where macOS stores
# xattrs in `._*` files that the Docker build context can't stat ("failed to
# xattr ... operation not permitted"). Nothing needs them in the image.
**/._*
**/.DS_Store
news_dataset/.env
